==History==
2016
*The Lightning [[Cards|card]] was added with Clash Royale's game launch on 4/1/2016.
*On 19/2/2016, the [[Version History#Balance Changes (19/2/2016)|Balance Update]], decreased the Lightning's [[:Category:Crown Towers|Crown Tower]] damage to 40% of the full damage (from 50%).
*On 19/9/2016, the [[Version History#September%202016%20Update%20(19/9/2016)|September 2016 Update]], allowed the Lightning to stun enemies for 0.5 seconds. The update also changed the description. Previously, it used to say "''Bolts of lightning hit up to three enemy troops or buildings with the most hitpoints in the target area. Reduced damage to Crown Towers.''"
2017
*On 9/10/2017, the [[Version History#Epic Quests Update (9/10/2017)|Epic Quests Update]], decreased Lightning's damage by 3% and its area radius to 3 tiles (from 3.5 tiles).
*On 12/12/2017, the [[Version History#Electrifying Update (12/12/2017)|Electrifying Update]], decreased the Lightning’s Crown Tower damage to 35% of the full damage (from 40%).
2018
*On 25/4/2018, the [[Version History#Clan%20Wars%20Update%20(25/4/2018)|Clan Wars Update]], increased the Lightning’s area radius to 3.5 tiles (from 3 tiles). It also allowed the Lightning to be placed on the river.
*On 20/6/2018, the [[Version History#Summer%202018%20Update%20(20/6/2018)|Summer 2018 Update]], moved the [[Arenas|Arena]] to unlock the Lightning from Goblin Stadium to P.E.K.K.A's Playhouse.
*On 3/9/2018, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (3/9/2018)|Balance Update]], increased the Lightning's damage by 5%. It also made it so that the Lightning can no longer reset the attack of the [[Zappies]].
*On 5/9/2018, the [[Version History#September%202018%20Update%20(5/9/2018)|September 2018 Update]], changed it so that {{Rarity|Epic}} cards start at Level 6 and end at Level 13 (from 1 to 8).
*On 1/10/2018, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (1/10/2018)|Balance Update]], fixed a bug where [[:Category:Troop Cards|troops]] that were spawned after their parent troops died would be immune to [[:Category:Spell Cards|spell]] damage.
2020
*On 4/8/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/8/2020)|Balance Update]], decreased the Lightning's Crown Tower damage to 30% of the full damage (from 35%).
*On 19/11/2020, a [[Version History#Maintenance%20Break%20(19/11/2020)|maintenance break]], fixed a bug where using Lightning on an [[Electro Giant]] would cause the game to crash.
2021
*On 7/6/2021, the [[Version History#Summer%202021%20Update%20(7/6/2021)|Summer 2021 Update]], moved the Arena to unlock the Lightning from P.E.K.K.A's Playhouse to Frozen Peak.
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions%20Update%20(27/10/2021)|Champions Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 14 (from 13).
2022
*On 30/3/2022, the [[Version History#Miner%20Update%20(30/3/2022)|Miner Update]], gave the Lightning a visual effect that shows even if it does not damage anything.
2023
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14).
2025
*On 31/3/2025, the [[Version History#2025 Quarter 1 Update (31/3/2025)|2025 Quarter 1 Update]], increased the Lightning's damage by 0.09%.
*On 3/6/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (3/6/2025)|Balance Update]], decreased the Lightning's Crown Tower damage to 27% of the full damage (from 30%).
*On 24/11/2025, the 2025 Quarter 4 Update added a card render to the Lightning's card info screen.
2026

* On 1/6/2026, a Balance Update, decreased the Lightning's Crown Tower damage to 25% of the full damage (from 27%)

